  <title>Time clock history</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Time clock</gui><gui>Time clock
  history</gui></guiseq> shows one week of finished punches, a column for each
  day from Sunday to Saturday, with each day's total under it and <gui>Total
  time for this week :</gui> at the bottom.</p>

  <p>Choose the <gui>Employee</gui> and the <gui>Project</gui>, or check
  <gui>View all</gui> beside either to include everyone or every project.
  <gui>Previous Week</gui> and <gui>Next Week</gui> move through the weeks. To
  correct a punch, use the <link xref="time_clock_tool"/>.</p>

</page>
